        <mxCell id="jenkins" value="&lt;b&gt;Jenkins&lt;/b&gt; (Jenkinsfile · params VERSION, EJECUTAR_TESTS)&lt;br&gt;1. Info del commit&lt;br&gt;2. Backend: &lt;code&gt;docker build --target test&lt;/code&gt; + Postgres 16 temporal → pytest (JUnit)&lt;br&gt;3. Frontend: &lt;code&gt;docker build --target build&lt;/code&gt; (Vite)&lt;br&gt;4. Build imágenes &lt;code&gt;runtime&lt;/code&gt; (tag VERSION + latest)&lt;br&gt;5. Push a Docker Hub (credencial dockerhub-credentials)&lt;br&gt;6. Deploy: &lt;code&gt;kubectl set image&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;rollout status&lt;/code&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
